  "configuration_id": "config_011",
  "reason": "RNA-only results show that multiprofile aggregation can be strongly beneficial, especially with scvi_n200, while image-only ResNet50 with a single profile is very weak. The key uncertainty is whether the image modality contains useful signal when given the same multiprofile/aggregation treatment that helped RNA. config_011 tests image-only ResNet50 with multiprofile avgpool, a one-factor extension of config_010, so it isolates the effect of profile setting/aggregation for image. This is a better use of the next budget than jumping to multimodal fusion or changing the image encoder at the same time, because it establishes whether image features are worth combining before testing more complex fusion designs."
}

